OpenSim (opensim-core)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`BioMotion/Muscle/MusclePathWrap.h` and `BioMotion/Muscle/MusclePathWrap.cpp`
are a port of the muscle path-wrapping code in OpenSim:

    OpenSim/Simulation/Wrap/WrapCylinder.cpp
    OpenSim/Simulation/Wrap/WrapEllipsoid.cpp
    OpenSim/Simulation/Wrap/WrapObject.cpp
    OpenSim/Simulation/Wrap/WrapMath.cpp
    OpenSim/Simulation/Model/GeometryPath.cpp
    OpenSim/Common/SimmMacros.h

    Copyright (c) 2005-2017 Stanford University and the Authors
    Author(s): Peter Loan, Frank C. Anderson, Ajay Seth
    Portions of WrapMath.cpp were originally developed by
    Realistic Dynamics Inc.; author Frank C. Anderson.

